  "title": "Timurid Empire",
  "summary": "The Timurid Empire was the state founded by Timur (Tamerlane), who by 1370 had established his capital at Samarkand. After his death the capital moved to Herat, and his son Shah Rukh ruled the eastern empire from 1409 to 1446. Shibani Khan's Uzbeks seized the Timurid capital, Herat, in 1507.",
